igcaption>《嫁金釵》大結局追劇日曆。（微博@嫁金釵官微）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《嫁金釵》大結局追劇日曆。（微博@嫁金釵官微）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261026/1191331509093535744023548.png/ZlMlIUNX33nI_5ALpD6YgRDJVFlVjXLcwk2GgcJNhoE\"/><figcaption>《嫁金釵》大結局追劇日曆。（微博@嫁金釵官微）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《嫁金釵》大結局追劇日曆。（微博@田曦薇不拍我來拍）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261026/1191331511568306176326485.png/5VS0OF5B7q6ZiuK51kCagQ1y8fU0uv5nh9vIwYfbyME\"/><figcaption>《嫁金釵》大結局追劇日曆。（微博@田曦薇不拍我來拍）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《嫁金釵》大結局追劇日曆。（微博@田曦薇不拍我來拍）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261026/1191331513866915840034875.png/VnT_jkRgyqtmw_mJkqE00oNROjpD2kNnIf5cDiH-XA4\"/><figcaption>《嫁金釵》大結局追劇日曆。（微博@田曦薇不拍我來拍）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《嫁金釵》大結局追劇日曆。（微博@田曦薇不拍我來拍）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261026/1191331515897090048089412.png/4IrUuYgYcP5SREZqORphC1dmsf9_NBvxrcYffK3GH3w\"/><figcaption>《嫁金釵》大結局追劇日曆。（微博@田曦薇不拍我來拍）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《嫁金釵》大結局追劇日曆。（微博@田曦薇不拍我來拍）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261026/1191331518157950976530762.png/8XF6hPc-qKNMNNqk2ZW20dT-agnTg5FdwTN72cEze9k\"/><figcaption>《嫁金釵》大結局追劇日曆。（微博@田曦薇不拍我來拍）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《嫁金釵》大結局追劇日曆。（微博@田曦薇不拍我來拍）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261026/1191331473953656832832794.png/s--SMQMl9dmYmlfFDQJUTLDN0I9A-mOqjjKJTY4yiU0\"/><figcaption>《嫁金釵》大結局追劇日曆。（微博@田曦薇不拍我來拍）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《嫁金釵》大結局追劇日曆。（微博@田曦薇不拍我來拍）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261026/1191331476583616512543217.png/-Q_zpyGJejlZivQ-Q5BoWqp2oRyVrGDv_fDwsf3w8LE\"/><figcaption>《嫁金釵》大結局追劇日曆。（微博@田曦薇不拍我來拍）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T09:02:07.806016+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1659,"images":28,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T08:45:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T09:5